    {"id":"flow_t","type":"text","x":65,"y":1007,"width":1410,"height":102,"angle":0,"strokeColor":"#334155","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":1,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"groupIds":[],"frameId":null,"index":"d9","roundness":null,"seed":40,"version":1,"versionNonce":40,"isDeleted":false,"boundElements":null,"updated":1787616000000,"link":null,"locked":false,"text":"Data placement (B1/B2 P=256; B4/B8 P=512):  hidden shard HX = 16 / 8 per x-column · mixer H = 16 / 8 and FFN F = 48 / 24 per y-row · KV feature = 4 / 2 per y-row · KV sequence cache = 18 / 9 positions per x-column.\nFull path: projection [X reduce] → KV-head scoped Y collectives → score max/value [X] → output [Y] → FFN up [X] → FFN down [Y].\nGDN path: projection [X] → QK/value-head scoped Y bands → recurrence contractions [X] → output [Y] → same FFN. Colors 0–4 are repainted synchronously between these domains.","fontSize":16,"fontFamily":2,"textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"middle","containerId":null,"originalText":"Data placement (B1/B2 P=256; B4/B8 P=512):  hidden shard HX = 16 / 8 per x-column · mixer H = 16 / 8 and FFN F = 48 / 24 per y-row · KV feature = 4 / 2 per y-row · KV sequence cache = 18 / 9 positions per x-column.\nFull path: projection [X reduce] → KV-head scoped Y collectives → score max/value [X] → output [Y] → FFN up [X] → FFN down [Y].\nGDN path: projection [X] → QK/value-head scoped Y bands → recurrence contractions [X] → output [Y] → same FFN. Colors 0–4 are repainted synchronously between these domains.","autoResize":true,"lineHeight":1.25}
